<title>ITALY: Indosuez lowers stake in Pirelli &amp; C.</title>
<headline>Indosuez lowers stake in Pirelli &amp; C.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Agricole Indosuez has lowered its stake in Pirelli &amp; C, the holding which controls tyre and cablemaker Pirelli, a regular bulletin from Italian stock market watchdog Consob said.</p>
<p>Indosuez's stake fell to 2.32 percent by July 30 from 2.84 percent at the last shareholder meeting and 3.87 percent held two years ago.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
